Sincronizar datos · confirmar
<div class="th th-{{theme}}" data-os="{{os}}" style="width: 1280px; height: 800px; position: relative; overflow: hidden">
  <div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 1280px; height: 800px">
    <dc-import name="DataDiffResult" theme="{{theme}}" os="{{os}}" hint-size="1280px,800px"></dc-import>
  </div>
  <div class="dlg-scrim">
    <div class="dlg" role="alertdialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ddcTitle" aria-describedby="ddcDesc" style="width: 540px">
      <div class="dlg-h">
        <span style="width: 28px; height: 28px; flex: none; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: var(--danger-soft); color: var(--danger)"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span>
        <span id="ddcTitle" style="flex: 1">¿Aplicar 3 cambios en Ventas copia?</span>
        <a href="DataDiffResult.dc.html" class="btn btn-icon" aria-label="Cancelar (Esc)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"></path></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="dlg-b">
        <div id="ddcDesc" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; line-height: 1.5">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap">Vas a modificar <span aria-hidden="true" style="width: 8px; height: 8px; flex: none; border-radius: 50%; background: #2e9e52"></span><b>Ventas copia › main.clientes</b></div>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap"><span class="chip" style="background: var(--ok-soft); color: var(--ok)">1 INSERT</span><span class="chip" style="background: var(--warn-soft); color: var(--warn)">2 UPDATE</span><span class="chip" style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--text-dim); border: 1px solid var(--border)">0 DELETE</span></div>
          <div style="font-size: var(--fs-sm); color: var(--text-dim)">Se comparó la tabla completa por id (12 filas en Ventas, 11 en Ventas copia). Las 3 sentencias van en una transacción: si una falla, no se aplica ninguna.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: var(--r-md); background: var(--surface); font-size: var(--fs-sm); color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.45"><span style="display: flex; flex: none; margin-top: 1px; color: var(--text-dim)"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></span><span>Ventas copia no está protegida. En una conexión protegida (como Producción) tendrías que escribir su nombre para confirmar.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="dlg-f">
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-ghost"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="12" height="12" rx="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>Copiar SQL</a>
        <span class="help">Esc cancela</span>
        <span style="flex: 1"></span>
        <span class="dlg-actions"><a href="DataGrid.dc.html" class="btn btn-danger">Aplicar 3 cambios</a><a href="DataDiffResult.dc.html" class="btn focus">Cancelar</a></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
---PROPS---
{"theme":{"editor":"enum","options":["b","a","c","rosa"],"default":"b"},"os":{"editor":"enum","options":["windows","macos","linux"],"default":"windows"},"$preview":{"width":1280,"height":800}}
---JS---
class Component extends DCLogic {
  renderVals() {
    return {
      theme: this.props.theme ?? 'b',
      os: this.props.os ?? 'windows',
      noLine: 0,
    };
  }
}
